### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 68/100.** Evidence GDPval 1495 ; Toolathon 46.3 ; Claw 62.7; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 64/100.** Evidence LCR 69.8 ; GPQA 87 ; Tau3-col 67.6; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 70/100.** 196K–205K (200K class) / 131K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 15/100.** Text in/out only; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 70/100.** Evidence SWE-Pro 56.22 ; VIBE 55.6 ; TB2 57%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 90/100.** Paid $0.30/$1.20 per 1M (no Free ID; $0 at promo).
- **Overall Score: 57/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (68+64+70+15+70)/5=57.4 → 57; best-fit per scoring methodology.

